detection, dramatically reducing diagnostic time and improving
performance, especially for non-specialists
\protect\hyperlink{references}{\textbf{{[}2{]}}}.

This table sharply contrasts the performance and inherent limitations of
manual versus AI-driven ECG interpretation.

