penalty (WGAN-GP). \\
\textbf{Instability} & Oscillating losses, difficulty in convergence. &
Careful hyperparameter tuning, advanced optimizers (e.g., Adam),
architectural modifications (e.g., spectral normalization). \\
\bottomrule()
\end{longtable}

