\hypertarget{gans-and-synthetic-ecg-generation}{%
\subsubsection{1.2.5 GANs and Synthetic ECG
Generation}\label{gans-and-synthetic-ecg-generation}}

Generative Adversarial Networks (GANs) are utilized in HeartLine to
address data imbalance and augment underrepresented classes such as rare
arrhythmias.

\textbf{a) GAN Architecture for ECGs}

GANs consist of two networks:
\protect\hyperlink{references}{\textbf{{[}20{]}}}

\begin{itemize}
\item
  \textbf{Generator}: Produces realistic ECG samples from random noise
\item
  \textbf{Discriminator}: Distinguishes between real and synthetic ECGs
\end{itemize}

HeartLine uses a 1D Deep Convolutional GAN variant (DCGAN-1D), tuned
specifically for ECG signal morphologies.

