These techniques ensure that HeartLine maintains high performance even
in challenging real-world datasets, ultimately contributing to equity
and robustness in AI-assisted cardiology.

\hypertarget{datasets-benchmarking-and-methodology-of-heartline}{%
\subsection{1.3 Datasets, Benchmarking, and Methodology of
HeartLine}\label{datasets-benchmarking-and-methodology-of-heartline}}

The \textbf{HeartLine} project\textquotesingle s effectiveness hinges on
its rigorous approach to data and its systematic methodology. This
section outlines the data infrastructure, benchmarking strategies, and
methodological rigor behind HeartLine. It is structured into four key
parts: ECG datasets and curation, model benchmarking and validation,
system methodology, and ethical/societal impact. Together, these
elements support HeartLine\textquotesingle s mission of deploying
equitable, high-performing cardiac diagnostics across Algeria.

