\textbf{a) Dataset Sources and Coverage}

HeartLine uses a blend of publicly available and proprietary datasets to
ensure comprehensive coverage of cardiac conditions, demographics, and
recording qualities, enhancing model generalization and mitigating bias.

The subsequent table clearly lays out the multi-source data strategy.
The inclusion of the \textbf{Ibn Rochd Hospital ECG Dataset} is
particularly crucial; it ensures the models are well-calibrated to the
specific patient population and ECG characteristics prevalent in
Algeria, directly addressing the local context of HeartLine.

