enforceable procedures.

\textbf{d) Registered Research Outputs and Open Science}

HeartLine contributes to the open science movement via:

\begin{itemize}
\item
  \textbf{Preprints and Repositories}: Timely publication of results via
  arXiv, Zenodo, and OSF.
\item
  \textbf{Model Zoo Contributions}: Publishing of lightweight 1D-CNN and
  ResNet-based architectures for ECG.
\item
  \textbf{Federated Learning Frameworks}: Modular FL simulations using
