This table outlines the layer-wise structure of a 1D ResNet-34 tailored
for multi-lead ECG input. The architecture deepens progressively to
capture hierarchical temporal patterns across leads. Residual
connections preserve low-level signal features while enabling deeper
abstraction. The final global pooling layer compresses features into a
compact diagnostic representation.

