HeartLine\textquotesingle s internal capacities and external environment
are synthesized through a focused SWOT analysis.

HeartLine combines cutting-edge AI with privacy-preserving FL and edge
deployment for rural access. Its complexity and reliance on data quality
pose internal scalability and maintenance challenges. Rising eHealth
momentum, regulatory support, and rural cardiology gaps offer strong
expansion potential. However, success hinges on overcoming
infrastructure gaps, clinician adoption, and evolving compliance risks
\protect\hyperlink{references}{\textbf{{[}43{]}}}.

