Market}\label{global-and-local-ecg-diagnostic-market}}

HeartLine enters a rapidly growing global ECG diagnostic market
projected to exceed \textbf{\$12 billion by 2030}, driven by the aging
population, increasing incidence of cardiovascular disease (CVD), and
technological innovations in AI and remote diagnostics (Global Market
Insights, 2023). In Algeria, the \textbf{ECG services submarket} is
expanding, with more than \textbf{1,200 private clinics} and
\textbf{400+ hospitals} representing immediate opportunities. Coupled
with the expansion of \textbf{50+ telemedicine platforms}, the country
is evolving into a promising testing ground for scalable, privacy-aware
diagnostic tools.

