Under the optimistic revenue scenario, HeartLine projects an initial
\textbf{Net Loss in Year 1}, primarily due to the substantial upfront
CAPEX and OPEX. However, this swiftly transitions to significant
\textbf{Net Profitability in Year 2 (over 15 million DZD)} and robust
growth in \textbf{Year 3 (over 36 million DZD)}, demonstrating the
strong long-term financial viability.

