\textbf{Model Training} & 5--8 & GNN + CNN development & Accuracy
\textgreater95\% on arrhythmia detection \\
\textbf{Prototype \& UX} & 9--10 & Dashboard and Figma UI & Interactive
web dashboard (React) \\
\textbf{Clinical Validation} & 11--15 & Pilot testing in 15 clinics &
≥90\% clinician approval \\
\textbf{Commercial Launch} & 16--24 & Scaling, user onboarding & 100
subscriptions \\
\textbf{Mobile/Edge Expansion} & Y2--Y4 & Pi-compatible inference, app
dev & 200K downloads \\
\textbf{MENA Rollout} & Y4--Y5 & Regional licensing, scale-up & 1,000
clinics across MENA \\
