Loop}\label{design-build-test-loop}}

HeartLine employs a Build-Measure-Learn loop:

\begin{itemize}
\item
  \emph{Build}: Prototype modules (ECG classifier, UI screen)
\item
  \emph{Measure}: Real-world clinician feedback and analytics
\item
  \emph{Learn}: Refine architecture (e.g., FL weight averaging
  techniques)
\end{itemize}

Each loop runs every 3 sprints, ensuring adaptive innovation based on
user and system feedback.

