    \textbf{Model Development (Months 5-8):} This period was dedicated
    to the intricate task of \textbf{training our Graph Neural Network
    (GNN)}, rigorously optimizing it to achieve its remarkable
    \textbf{95\%+ accuracy} in arrhythmia detection.
  \item
    \textbf{Prototype Design (Months 9-10):} The user experience took
    center stage, with the development of intuitive \textbf{Figma
    mockups} and the foundational design of our interactive dashboard.
  \item
    \textbf{Clinical Validation (Months 11-15):} A critical phase
    involving \textbf{real-world testing in 15 clinics}, targeting a
    \textbf{90\% approval rate} to ensure clinical utility and
    acceptance.
  \item
    \textbf{Commercial Launch (Months 16-24):} This phase marks our
    official market entry, with a strategic goal to onboard \textbf{100
    subscriptions} and establish a strong user base.
  \item
    \textbf{Expansion (Years 2-4):} Beyond Algeria, this phase focuses
    on developing mobile capabilities and integrating new sensor
    technologies, aiming for \textbf{200,000 downloads} across various
    platforms.
  \item
    \textbf{MENA Rollout (Years 4-5):} Our regional ambition takes
    shape, targeting the expansion of HeartLine to \textbf{1,000
