\hypertarget{the-final-heartline-prototype}{%
\subsubsection{5.3.1 The Final HeartLine
Prototype}\label{the-final-heartline-prototype}}

HeartLine\textquotesingle s prototype is a high-performance,
cross-platform SaaS diagnostic tool tailored for federated ECG analysis.
Developed through iterative Agile sprints, each phase of
implementation---from UI/UX to deployment---was aligned with clinical
needs and technical scalability.

\begin{itemize}
\item
  \textbf{Platform Design:} Web and mobile compatibility ensure access
  across clinical environments.
\item
