  \textbf{Real-Time Inference:} Analysis is automatically triggered
  using the federated GNN model, with results returned within 1 second.
\item
  \textbf{Interpretability:} Visual diagnostic overlays and confidence
  scores aid clinicians in trust-based decision-making.
\item
  \textbf{User-Centric UI:} Interface optimized for speed and clarity
  using React 18, Figma wireframes, and continuous feedback from early
  adopters \protect\hyperlink{references}{\textbf{{[}65{]}}}.
\end{itemize}

